// ============================================================================
//  jlink_test.jlink -- J-Link self test (no target board needed)
//
//  Purpose: check that Windows sees the J-Link, that the SEGGER software
//  accepts it (clone check), and to read out its serial number / firmware.
//
//  How to run (from any folder):
//    & 'C:\Program Files\SEGGER\JLink_V980\JLink.exe' -NoGui 1 -CommanderScript D:\ForTest\HW1\tools\jlink_test.jlink
//
//  If V9.80 refuses the clone, try the older V9.68 install instead:
//    & 'C:\Program Files\SEGGER\JLink_V968\JLink.exe' -NoGui 1 -CommanderScript D:\ForTest\HW1\tools\jlink_test.jlink
// ============================================================================

ShowEmuList
ShowHWStatus
q
